{"id":"9dfcc3adeccae558","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/088_ω-规则演算.md","title":"088 ω-规则演算","display":"088_ω-规则演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-算术一阶签名\">1. 算术一阶签名</h1>\n<p>变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。函数符号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\times\">\\(\\times\\)</span>，元数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2,2\">\\(0,1,2,2\\)</span>。关系符号只有等词。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq Var\">\\(X\\subseteq Var\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fresh(X)\">\\(fresh(X)\\)</span> 是不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中的最小指标变量。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与数码\">2. 项与数码</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_\\omega\">\\(Tm_\\omega\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_\\omega\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"zero\\in Tm_\\omega\">\\(zero\\in Tm_\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in Tm_\\omega\">\\(t\\in Tm_\\omega\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"succ(t)\\in Tm_\\omega\">\\(succ(t)\\in Tm_\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"add(s,t)\\in Tm_\\omega\">\\(add(s,t)\\in Tm_\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mul(s,t)\\in Tm_\\omega\">\\(mul(s,t)\\in Tm_\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>数码函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar 0=zero\">\\(\\bar 0=zero\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n+1}=succ(\\bar n)\">\\(\\overline{n+1}=succ(\\bar n)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-公式、自由变量与替换\">3. 公式、自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_\\omega\">\\(Frm_\\omega\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_\\omega\">\\(eq(s,t)\\in Frm_\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_\\omega\">\\(A\\in Frm_\\omega\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(A)\\in Frm_\\omega\">\\(neg(A)\\in Frm_\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_\\omega\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_\\omega\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_\\omega\">\\(A\\in Frm_\\omega\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(x,A)\\in Frm_\\omega\">\\(all(x,A)\\in Frm_\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>项自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T:Tm_\\omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\">\\(FV_T:Tm_\\omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\nFV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\nFV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV:Frm_\\omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\">\\(FV:Frm_\\omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(neg(A))=FV(A),\\quad FV(imp(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(neg(A))=FV(A),\\quad FV(imp(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(all(x,A))=FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(all(x,A))=FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BV:Frm_\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\">\\(BV:Frm_\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\qquad BV(neg(A))=BV(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\qquad BV(neg(A))=BV(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV(imp(A,B))=BV(A)\\cup BV(B),\n\\qquad\nBV(all(x,A))=BV(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV(imp(A,B))=BV(A)\\cup BV(B),\n\\qquad\nBV(all(x,A))=BV(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_T:Tm_\\omega\\times Var\\times Tm_\\omega\\to Tm_\\omega\">\\(Sub_T:Tm_\\omega\\times Var\\times Tm_\\omega\\to Tm_\\omega\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"zero[x:=s]=zero,\n\\quad\nsucc(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[zero[x:=s]=zero,\n\\quad\nsucc(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"mul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[mul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_F:Frm_\\omega\\times Var\\times Tm_\\omega\\to Frm_\\omega\">\\(Sub_F:Frm_\\omega\\times Var\\times Tm_\\omega\\to Frm_\\omega\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nimp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nimp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)\">\\(all(y,A)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A)\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A)\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in FV_T(s)\">\\(y\\in FV_T(s)\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=fresh(FV(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=fresh(FV(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-alpha-等价与上下文\">4. alpha 等价与上下文</h1>\n<p>定义类型化的改名生成关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"AlphaRename_\\omega=\\{(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])):\nx,y\\in Var,\\ A\\in Frm_\\omega,\\ y\\notin FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[AlphaRename_\\omega=\\{(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])):\nx,y\\in Var,\\ A\\in Frm_\\omega,\\ y\\notin FV(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal E_\\omega\\)</span> 是以下候选等价关系的集合：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq Frm_\\omega^2\">\\(E\\subseteq Frm_\\omega^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_\\omega\">\\(Frm_\\omega\\)</span> 上自反、对称、传递，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AlphaRename_\\omega\\subseteq E\">\\(AlphaRename_\\omega\\subseteq E\\)</span>，并且对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,A&#39;,B,B&#39;\\in Frm_\\omega\">\\(A,A&#39;,B,B&#39;\\in Frm_\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;)\\in E\\Rightarrow(neg(A),neg(A&#39;))\\in E\\land(all(x,A),all(x,A&#39;))\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,A&#39;)\\in E\\Rightarrow(neg(A),neg(A&#39;))\\in E\\land(all(x,A),all(x,A&#39;))\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;)\\in E\\land(B,B&#39;)\\in E\\Rightarrow(imp(A,B),imp(A&#39;,B&#39;))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,A&#39;)\\in E\\land(B,B&#39;)\\in E\\Rightarrow(imp(A,B),imp(A&#39;,B&#39;))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该候选族非空，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_\\omega^2\\in\\mathcal E_\\omega\">\\(Frm_\\omega^2\\in\\mathcal E_\\omega\\)</span>。精确定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^\\omega B\\Longleftrightarrow\nA,B\\in Frm_\\omega\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal E_\\omega\\ (A,B)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^\\omega B\\Longleftrightarrow\nA,B\\in Frm_\\omega\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal E_\\omega\\ (A,B)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它是包含安全改名且与全部公式构造相容的最小等价关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq\">\\(eq\\)</span> 的项参数没有公式子位，字面相同的原子对由自反性给出。这里没有额外商去项运算或逻辑等式。上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_\\omega\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_\\omega\\)</span> 可为任意公式集。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-逻辑公理集合\">5. 逻辑公理集合</h1>\n<p>逻辑公理集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_\\omega^0\">\\(Ax_\\omega^0\\)</span> 是下列集合的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to1}^\\omega,Ax_{\\to2}^\\omega,Ax_{\\to3}^\\omega,\nAx_{\\forall1}^\\omega,Ax_{\\forall2}^\\omega,Ax_{=1}^\\omega,Ax_{=2}^\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to1}^\\omega,Ax_{\\to2}^\\omega,Ax_{\\to3}^\\omega,\nAx_{\\forall1}^\\omega,Ax_{\\forall2}^\\omega,Ax_{=1}^\\omega,Ax_{=2}^\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to1}^\\omega=\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to1}^\\omega=\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to2}^\\omega=\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to2}^\\omega=\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to3}^\\omega=\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to3}^\\omega=\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall1}^\\omega=\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_\\omega,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall1}^\\omega=\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_\\omega,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall2}^\\omega\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):\nx\\in Var,\\ A,B\\in Frm_\\omega,\\ x\\notin FV(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall2}^\\omega\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):\nx\\in Var,\\ A,B\\in Frm_\\omega,\\ x\\notin FV(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=1}^\\omega=\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=1}^\\omega=\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=2}^\\omega=\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_\\omega,t,u\\in Tm_\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=2}^\\omega=\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_\\omega,t,u\\in Tm_\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>算术公理拆成下列项参数族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{S0}\n=\n\\{neg(eq(succ(t),zero)):t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{S0}\n=\n\\{neg(eq(succ(t),zero)):t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{Sinj}\n=\n\\{imp(eq(succ(s),succ(t)),eq(s,t)):s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{Sinj}\n=\n\\{imp(eq(succ(s),succ(t)),eq(s,t)):s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{+0}\n=\n\\{eq(add(t,zero),t):t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{+0}\n=\n\\{eq(add(t,zero),t):t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{+S}\n=\n\\{eq(add(s,succ(t)),succ(add(s,t))):s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{+S}\n=\n\\{eq(add(s,succ(t)),succ(add(s,t))):s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\times0}\n=\n\\{eq(mul(t,zero),zero):t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\times0}\n=\n\\{eq(mul(t,zero),zero):t\\in Tm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\times S}\n=\n\\{eq(mul(s,succ(t)),add(mul(s,t),s)):s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\times S}\n=\n\\{eq(mul(s,succ(t)),add(mul(s,t),s)):s,t\\in Tm_\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{arith}\n=\nAx_{S0}\\cup Ax_{Sinj}\\cup Ax_{+0}\\cup Ax_{+S}\\cup Ax_{\\times0}\\cup Ax_{\\times S},\n\\qquad\nAx_\\omega=Ax_\\omega^0\\cup Ax_{arith}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{arith}\n=\nAx_{S0}\\cup Ax_{Sinj}\\cup Ax_{+0}\\cup Ax_{+S}\\cup Ax_{\\times0}\\cup Ax_{\\times S},\n\\qquad\nAx_\\omega=Ax_\\omega^0\\cup Ax_{arith}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-有限规则与-ω-规则\">6. 有限规则与 ω 规则</h1>\n<p>分离规则、全称推广规则与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 规则分别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to}^\\omega=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_\\omega\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to}^\\omega=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_\\omega\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\forall}^\\omega\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,(A)),all(x,A)):\n\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_\\omega,\\ A\\in Frm_\\omega,\\ x\\in Var,\\\nx\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV(B)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\forall}^\\omega\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,(A)),all(x,A)):\n\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_\\omega,\\ A\\in Frm_\\omega,\\ x\\in Var,\\\nx\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV(B)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\alpha}^\\omega=\\{((A),B):A\\equiv_\\alpha^\\omega B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\alpha}^\\omega=\\{((A),B):A\\equiv_\\alpha^\\omega B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>ω 规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\omega}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\left(\n(A[x:=\\bar n])_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\nall(x,A)\n\\right):\nx\\in Var,\\ A\\in Frm_\\omega\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\omega}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\left(\n(A[x:=\\bar n])_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\nall(x,A)\n\\right):\nx\\in Var,\\ A\\in Frm_\\omega\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-ω-证明树\">7. ω 证明树</h1>\n<p>前缀序、前缀封闭、直接后继和子节点函数定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\preceq t\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\ t=s^\\frown u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\preceq t\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\ t=s^\\frown u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrefixClosed}(T)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\,\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\,(s\\preceq t\\Rightarrow s\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PrefixClosed}(T)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\,\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\,(s\\preceq t\\Rightarrow s\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}_{T}(s,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns,t\\in T\\land \\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ t=s^\\frown\\langle k\\rangle,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Succ}_{T}(s,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns,t\\in T\\land \\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ t=s^\\frown\\langle k\\rangle,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(s)=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{Succ}_{T}(s,t)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(s)=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{Succ}_{T}(s,t)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Enum_\\omega(e,X)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ne:\\mathbb N\\to X\n\\land \\operatorname{rng}(e)=X\n\\land \\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\,(e(i)=e(j)\\Rightarrow i=j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Enum_\\omega(e,X)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ne:\\mathbb N\\to X\n\\land \\operatorname{rng}(e)=X\n\\land \\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\,(e(i)=e(j)\\Rightarrow i=j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>良基谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"WF(T)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists b:\\mathbb N\\to T\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\operatorname{Succ}_{T}(b(n),b(n+1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[WF(T)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists b:\\mathbb N\\to T\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\operatorname{Succ}_{T}(b(n),b(n+1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>节点许可谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\omega}(\\Gamma,T,\\lambda,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(t)=\\varnothing\\land\\lambda(t)\\in\\Gamma\\cup Ax_\\omega)\n\\lor\n\\exists u\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(t)=\\{u\\}\\land\n\\bigl(\n((\\lambda(u)),\\lambda(t))\\in Rule_{\\alpha}^\\omega\n\\lor\n((\\Gamma,(\\lambda(u))),\\lambda(t))\\in Rule_{\\forall}^\\omega\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\lor\n\\exists u_0,u_1\\,(u_0\\ne u_1\\land\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(t)=\\{u_0,u_1\\}\\land ((\\lambda(u_0),\\lambda(u_1)),\\lambda(t))\\in Rule_{\\to}^\\omega)\n\\lor\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N\\to\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(t)\\,\n\\bigl(Enum_\\omega(e,\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(t))\\land\n((\\lambda(e(n)))_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\lambda(t))\\in Rule_\\omega\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\omega}(\\Gamma,T,\\lambda,t)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(t)=\\varnothing\\land\\lambda(t)\\in\\Gamma\\cup Ax_\\omega)\n\\lor\n\\exists u\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(t)=\\{u\\}\\land\n\\bigl(\n((\\lambda(u)),\\lambda(t))\\in Rule_{\\alpha}^\\omega\n\\lor\n((\\Gamma,(\\lambda(u))),\\lambda(t))\\in Rule_{\\forall}^\\omega\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\lor\n\\exists u_0,u_1\\,(u_0\\ne u_1\\land\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(t)=\\{u_0,u_1\\}\\land ((\\lambda(u_0),\\lambda(u_1)),\\lambda(t))\\in Rule_{\\to}^\\omega)\n\\lor\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N\\to\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(t)\\,\n\\bigl(Enum_\\omega(e,\\operatorname{ch}_{T}(t))\\land\n((\\lambda(e(n)))_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\lambda(t))\\in Rule_\\omega\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\omega}(\\Gamma,T,\\le,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_\\omega\\land T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land \\operatorname{PrefixClosed}(T)\n\\land \\varnothing\\in T\n\\land WF(T)\n\\land \\le=\\preceq{\\upharpoonright}T\n\\land \\lambda:T\\to Frm_\\omega\n\\land \\forall t\\in T\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\omega}(\\Gamma,T,\\lambda,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\omega}(\\Gamma,T,\\le,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_\\omega\\land T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land \\operatorname{PrefixClosed}(T)\n\\land \\varnothing\\in T\n\\land WF(T)\n\\land \\le=\\preceq{\\upharpoonright}T\n\\land \\lambda:T\\to Frm_\\omega\n\\land \\forall t\\in T\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\omega}(\\Gamma,T,\\lambda,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\omega A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\,\\exists\\le\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\omega}(\\Gamma,T,\\le,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{\\omega}(T,\\lambda)=A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_\\omega A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\,\\exists\\le\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\omega}(\\Gamma,T,\\le,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{\\omega}(T,\\lambda)=A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootLab}_{\\omega}(T,\\lambda)=\\lambda(\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootLab}_{\\omega}(T,\\lambda)=\\lambda(\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义定理集合和闭包</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Thm_\\omega=\\{A\\in Frm_\\omega:\\varnothing\\vdash_\\omega A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Thm_\\omega=\\{A\\in Frm_\\omega:\\varnothing\\vdash_\\omega A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cn}_{\\omega}(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in Frm_\\omega:\\Gamma\\vdash_\\omega A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cn}_{\\omega}(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in Frm_\\omega:\\Gamma\\vdash_\\omega A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异条款\">9. 目标差异条款</h1>\n<p>目标差异为：本系统在有限一阶证明规则之外加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则，要求从所有数码实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=\\overline n]\">\\(A[x:=\\overline n]\\)</span> 的前提族推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,A\">\\(\\forall x\\,A\\)</span>；它不同于任意无穷分支规则的一般无穷证明系统。</p>\n<p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\omega}\n=\n(Rule_\\omega,\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\omega},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\omega},\n\\vdash_\\omega,\\mathsf{Cn}_{\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{\\omega}\n=\n(Rule_\\omega,\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\omega},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\omega},\n\\vdash_\\omega,\\mathsf{Cn}_{\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{\\omega}\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nTm_\\omega,\nFrm_\\omega,\nFV_T,\nSub_T,\nSub_F,\nAlphaRename_\\omega,\n\\mathcal E_\\omega,\nFV,\nBV,\nfresh,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^\\omega,\nAx_\\omega,\nRule_{\\to}^\\omega,\nRule_{\\forall}^\\omega,\nRule_{\\alpha}^\\omega,\nRule_\\omega,\n\\preceq,\n\\operatorname{PrefixClosed},\n\\operatorname{Succ}_{T},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{T},\nEnum_\\omega,\nWF,\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\omega},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\omega},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{\\omega},\n\\vdash_\\omega,\nThm_\\omega,\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{\\omega},\n\\Delta_{\\omega}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_{\\omega}\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nTm_\\omega,\nFrm_\\omega,\nFV_T,\nSub_T,\nSub_F,\nAlphaRename_\\omega,\n\\mathcal E_\\omega,\nFV,\nBV,\nfresh,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^\\omega,\nAx_\\omega,\nRule_{\\to}^\\omega,\nRule_{\\forall}^\\omega,\nRule_{\\alpha}^\\omega,\nRule_\\omega,\n\\preceq,\n\\operatorname{PrefixClosed},\n\\operatorname{Succ}_{T},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{T},\nEnum_\\omega,\nWF,\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\omega},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\omega},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{\\omega},\n\\vdash_\\omega,\nThm_\\omega,\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{\\omega},\n\\Delta_{\\omega}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含算术语言、逻辑公理、算术定义公理、良基证明树和 ω 规则；不含循环回边、评价函数或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-算术一阶签名","text":"1. 算术一阶签名","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与数码","text":"2. 项与数码","level":1},{"id":"3.-公式、自由变量与替换","text":"3. 公式、自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-alpha-等价与上下文","text":"4. alpha 等价与上下文","level":1},{"id":"5.-逻辑公理集合","text":"5. 逻辑公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-有限规则与-ω-规则","text":"6. 有限规则与 ω 规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-ω-证明树","text":"7. ω 证明树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异条款","text":"9. 目标差异条款","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\times","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,2,2","display":false},{"tex":"eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq Var","display":false},{"tex":"fresh(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Tm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\in Tm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"zero\\in Tm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in Tm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"succ(t)\\in Tm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"add(s,t)\\in Tm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"mul(s,t)\\in Tm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar 0=zero","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{n+1}=succ(\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"Frm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"neg(A)\\in Frm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"all(x,A)\\in Frm_\\omega","display